    {
        "content": "<p>What kind of inductive data types do you want to serialize? If a type has <code>proxy_equiv%</code> then you can define<code>deriving</code> relativelly easily by provinding an instance for unit, product, sum types and instance and pull it throught that equivalence.</p>\n<p>The main disadvantage this approach forces you to pay extra byte for every sum type that appears in the proxy type.</p>",
        "id": 625667432,
        "sender_full_name": "Tomas Skrivan",
        "timestamp": 1789978401
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I want it (and have this in the AI-generated prototype) to support basic inductives and also structures with <code>List</code> fields, as well as <code>Prop</code> fields that are decidable, e.g. to require that two List fields have the same length (could use a list of pairs instead but I assume two vecors will be mich faster for many thimgs I do with them).</p>",
        "id": 625669140,
        "sender_full_name": "Adomas Baliuka",
        "timestamp": 1789978903
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>For what it is worth, here is my solution using <code>proxy_equiv%</code>. It is something that is floating around bunch of my projects in similar forms.</p>\n<p>I define class <code>ByteType α</code> that has functions that can read and write <code>α</code> from/to <code>ByteArray</code>.</p>\n<p>Then I define function that can pull instance of this class along an equivalence</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofEquiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Equiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">...</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>And three basic instances</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">...</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊕</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">...</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">...</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>With that implemeting <code>deriving</code> is simple as</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">deriveByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">declName</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Name</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">indVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getConstInfoInduct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declName</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cmd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">liftTermElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">header</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Deriving</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkHeader</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">indVal</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">header</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binders</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">bracketedBinder</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">header</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">targetType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">ByteType</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofEquiv</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">proxy_equiv</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">header</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">targetType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">header</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">targetType</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symm</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">elabCommand</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cmd</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/uHVXR6WMf8sloB47TCpFJNbU/ByteTypeStandalone.lean\">ByteTypeStandalone.lean</a></p>",
        "id": 625678200,
        "sender_full_name": "Tomas Skrivan",
        "timestamp": 1789981327
    },
